WEBVTT

01:30.990 --> 01:35.980
A Revolution for Glasses Wearers

01:39.650 --> 01:42.670
I wonder if the president's
made it to Okinawa yet.

01:48.850 --> 01:51.560
Hey! Mitsuki!

01:51.560 --> 01:54.660
What do we do while the
others are off on their field trip?

01:54.660 --> 01:56.730
What do we do? What do we do?

01:56.730 --> 02:00.320
I wanna... I wanna... Um...

02:00.320 --> 02:01.800
Mitsuki, are you listening?

02:01.990 --> 02:07.180
Soma-senpai 45. Soma-senpai 46.

02:07.330 --> 02:10.480
Soma-senpai 47.

02:10.480 --> 02:13.440
Soma-senpai 48.

02:11.040 --> 02:14.490
Mitsuki, you're acting like
that dish-counting ghost.

02:13.440 --> 02:15.790
Soma-senpai 49.

02:15.790 --> 02:20.330
Soma-senpai 50. Soma-senpai—

02:25.300 --> 02:26.950
Too many presidents!

02:27.020 --> 02:27.580
Presidents!

02:29.090 --> 02:30.840
Please wait a moment.

02:30.840 --> 02:34.090
My eyes!

02:30.840 --> 02:34.090
Waaaugh!

02:41.070 --> 02:44.730
So, meet up at the hotel at 5:00, and...

02:45.060 --> 02:50.230
Hmm... And don't cause trouble. That's all.

02:53.670 --> 02:54.860
Dismisse—

02:53.900 --> 02:54.850
Yay!

02:56.400 --> 02:57.940
They're pretty fired up.

03:00.620 --> 03:02.080
Land of Propriety

03:00.620 --> 03:02.080
One, two!

03:03.480 --> 03:04.840
Okinawa!

03:05.460 --> 03:06.720
One, two!

03:08.010 --> 03:09.230
Okinawa!

03:22.220 --> 03:23.540
Here you are!

03:25.000 --> 03:26.220
Okinawa!

03:31.440 --> 03:33.220
No need to rush, Akira.

03:33.580 --> 03:34.980
The soki soba isn't going anywhere!

03:35.250 --> 03:37.260
So they cloud up in Okinawa, too.

03:37.260 --> 03:40.500
Hey, hey! If we do a diving tour...

03:41.510 --> 03:44.460
You think it's okay to take
pictures of the ocean?

03:44.460 --> 03:47.060
My brothers asked me to take some!

03:47.060 --> 03:48.980
I don't think that would be a problem.

03:48.980 --> 03:50.280
Hooray!

03:50.910 --> 03:52.790
Are you two all right with that?

03:53.860 --> 03:56.510
To dive, you have to take off your glasses.

04:00.040 --> 04:01.410
That's just...

04:01.410 --> 04:03.060
It's glasses discrimination!

04:07.300 --> 04:08.140
What?

04:15.770 --> 04:22.670
You can walk around underwater even with glasses on.

04:15.770 --> 04:22.670
Sea Walk

04:19.850 --> 04:22.740
You can walk around underwater
even with glasses on?!

04:22.740 --> 04:25.780
We reserved a place for you too, Soma-kun!

04:25.780 --> 04:26.730
Akira.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.950
The times...

04:30.480 --> 04:31.530
...are changing!

04:32.870 --> 04:35.450
Okinawa!

04:36.130 --> 04:39.140
Soma-senpai 995.

04:39.500 --> 04:42.890
Soma-senpai 996.

04:43.300 --> 04:46.480
Soma-senpai 997.

04:46.480 --> 04:48.810
Hey, is that actually fun?

04:48.810 --> 04:52.250
Soma-senpai 998.

04:52.250 --> 04:53.860
Mitsuki...

04:53.860 --> 04:57.560
Soma-senpai 999.

04:58.620 --> 05:01.090
Soma-senpai 1000...

05:06.610 --> 05:08.660
I'm one short.

05:09.870 --> 05:10.870
Sadness.

05:11.490 --> 05:13.000
Why not just call him?

05:14.130 --> 05:15.130
Club President

05:34.520 --> 05:36.130
It's so fast!

05:40.050 --> 05:42.930
Yukiya! Your bangs! Your bangs!

05:43.450 --> 05:45.800
The device you are trying to reach

05:45.800 --> 05:50.800
is currently out of range, or is turned off.

05:51.210 --> 05:53.400
Well, too bad.

05:53.400 --> 05:54.520
Ugh.

06:14.830 --> 06:16.060
This is...

06:20.610 --> 06:21.840
...the ocean.

06:30.180 --> 06:32.330
What a beautiful sight it was.

06:34.650 --> 06:36.050
Thank you!

06:37.110 --> 06:38.700
What are you doing?!

06:39.470 --> 06:41.700
You were wide open, Soma-kun!

06:41.700 --> 06:43.080
Stop it!

06:43.080 --> 06:44.720
Okay, if it comes to that...

06:45.930 --> 06:47.180
You will pay!

06:50.820 --> 06:52.120
Who's there?!

07:08.390 --> 07:10.730
Very well. I accept your challenge!

07:11.300 --> 07:13.870
Wait! My glasses can't take any more!

07:15.710 --> 07:18.490
Damn it! That's cowardly! Both of you!

07:18.490 --> 07:20.040
He's mad!

07:20.040 --> 07:21.040
Get back here!

07:21.920 --> 07:24.040
Mitsuki...

07:24.170 --> 07:26.810
Mitsuki!

07:29.650 --> 07:32.290
Mitsuki...

07:34.320 --> 07:36.800
Mitsuki!

07:38.860 --> 07:40.550
No good, huh?

07:46.920 --> 07:47.920
Huh?

07:49.810 --> 07:51.900
You're back already?!

07:52.040 --> 07:54.600
What? You were just so worried about us?

07:55.360 --> 07:58.290
Welcome back! President!

07:57.320 --> 07:58.920
Soma-senpai!

08:02.560 --> 08:04.260
You fell for it!

08:04.470 --> 08:06.240
The president isn't here!

08:11.420 --> 08:12.980
Can't get me!

08:14.180 --> 08:15.440
I did it!

08:16.180 --> 08:18.440
You've done it, Kimata Hayato!

08:18.440 --> 08:22.780
You finally, finally blocked
Kamatani Mitsuki's eye-crush attack

08:22.780 --> 08:24.730
with a lightning-fast guard!

08:24.730 --> 08:26.340
I will call this maneuver

08:26.340 --> 08:28.940
the eye-crush crusher!

08:30.300 --> 08:31.200
Huh?

08:35.490 --> 08:37.280
It looks like they left us behind.

08:37.280 --> 08:39.610
We played around too much.

08:40.440 --> 08:43.200
Regret will accomplish nothing. Yukiya!

08:43.500 --> 08:45.200
How far is it to Okinawa from here?

08:46.710 --> 08:48.940
I believe we're still in Okinawa, technically.

08:48.940 --> 08:51.490
I see! Then we can walk back from here!

08:51.490 --> 08:56.220
There's no way back by land.
Okinawa is made up of several islands.

08:56.670 --> 08:59.180
What?! It's not just that one?!

08:59.080 --> 08:59.810
That one.

09:00.240 --> 09:01.860
I see...

09:02.950 --> 09:04.170
We...

09:05.410 --> 09:07.850
...have to get back to the main island.

09:07.850 --> 09:08.690
What's wrong?

09:08.690 --> 09:11.200
Out of Range

09:09.910 --> 09:11.200
Out of range, huh?

09:13.940 --> 09:17.020
Well, I'm sure they'll notice
and come back for us soon.

09:17.020 --> 09:18.160
More importantly...

09:20.570 --> 09:21.490
Okay!

09:21.700 --> 09:23.760
Let's find something to eat!

09:23.760 --> 09:26.820
I'll search the jungle. Takuma,
you search the seaside!

09:26.820 --> 09:28.240
Roger!

09:28.460 --> 09:32.010
Can't use yPad... Can't use yPad...

09:29.450 --> 09:32.010
Yukiya! You idiot!

09:32.210 --> 09:34.500
You don't need the yPad!
You can do anything!

09:36.020 --> 09:37.020
Akira...

09:37.520 --> 09:40.090
Your duty is to start a fire!

09:41.480 --> 09:42.940
I've never done it before.

09:43.650 --> 09:45.480
I know you can do it!

09:46.530 --> 09:51.180
Only if I could use the yPad.
Now I can't get service, so...

09:53.030 --> 09:54.340
I'm counting on you!

09:56.060 --> 09:59.760
Glasses!

10:07.460 --> 10:08.450
Okay.

10:49.950 --> 10:52.390
Hey, Mitsuki!

10:54.370 --> 10:55.580
Are those...

10:55.580 --> 10:58.000
I think the screw broke.

10:58.390 --> 11:01.010
They're the glasses the president
picked out for you, right?

11:05.000 --> 11:06.820
<i>Yes, this is it!</i>

11:06.820 --> 11:09.160
<i>They look great on you, Mit-chan!</i>

11:09.160 --> 11:11.310
<i>Glasses with frames just on the bottom?</i>

11:11.310 --> 11:12.600
<i>That's unusual, huh?</i>

11:12.600 --> 11:14.660
<i>They're known as under-rim glasses.</i>

11:14.660 --> 11:17.250
<i>Wow, they're really stylish!</i>

11:17.960 --> 11:20.780
<i>You really think they look good on me?</i>

11:21.060 --> 11:23.280
<i>I picked them out.
There can be no question.</i>

11:23.640 --> 11:25.400
<i>You have been reborn!</i>

11:27.640 --> 11:29.290
<i>Soma-senpai...</i>

11:34.480 --> 11:37.100
Okay! Just leave it to me!

11:37.410 --> 11:39.910
I'm gonna fix them at a glasses shop!

11:40.840 --> 11:42.280
That guy...

11:48.800 --> 11:49.810
You okay?

11:53.520 --> 11:55.160
Little Hayato?

11:53.790 --> 11:56.750
Little

11:55.160 --> 11:56.980
Ikuto!

12:08.070 --> 12:10.050
Ikuto, where were you going?

12:11.360 --> 12:12.810
These glasses...

12:16.800 --> 12:19.260
Big

12:16.800 --> 12:19.260
Big Hayato?

12:19.710 --> 12:21.210
Can I help you?

12:22.740 --> 12:24.280
Ikuto!

12:24.280 --> 12:26.560
Huh? Big brother? Mitsuki?

12:26.560 --> 12:27.760
Big brother?

12:29.210 --> 12:31.520
First things first. Big brother...

12:31.520 --> 12:34.780
You don't miss a thing. Fine.

12:34.980 --> 12:36.830
I'll give them back.

12:36.830 --> 12:39.530
So... who are you?

12:37.750 --> 12:39.530
Kimata Ikuto
little brother

12:40.640 --> 12:43.780
What's this? A friend of Hayato's?

12:41.760 --> 12:43.780
Kimata Yuto
big brother

12:44.110 --> 12:45.630
Well...

12:45.630 --> 12:47.860
Yeah! We're in the same club!

12:47.860 --> 12:50.280
That's right, Mitsuki.
Your glasses are fixed!

12:50.800 --> 12:53.800
While I was at it, I used the latest
ultrasonic cleaner on them!

12:54.070 --> 12:56.030
They're really clean, see?

12:58.090 --> 13:01.110
I wanted to have Soma-senpai fix them!

13:09.890 --> 13:13.650
Oh, my! These glasses look
much better on you!

13:14.120 --> 13:16.900
Actually, you have a very cute face!

13:17.110 --> 13:19.150
It's Mitsuki-kun, right?

13:19.410 --> 13:21.910
Why don't you stop by our house?

13:21.910 --> 13:25.270
Tonight, for dinner,

13:25.450 --> 13:27.230
we're having yakiniku!

13:27.240 --> 13:29.410
Yakiniku! Yakiniku!

13:29.410 --> 13:32.780
I bought it at the store's once-a-year sale!

13:32.780 --> 13:35.300
It's the super top-grade brand-name beef!

13:35.300 --> 13:38.290
Beef! Yakiniku! Yakiniku!

13:38.290 --> 13:47.410
Yakiniku! Yakiniku!

13:38.610 --> 13:41.100
Um, I should be going.

13:41.100 --> 13:44.320
Let's go! While it's still fresh!

13:44.320 --> 13:45.960
No, I'd rather not.

13:47.410 --> 13:51.420
Beef! Beef! Beef!

13:48.240 --> 13:51.420
Mitsuki-kun, don't just smile, sing!

13:49.040 --> 13:50.350
W-Wait...

13:51.850 --> 13:52.930
Glasses!

13:56.440 --> 13:57.400
I've done it!

13:57.400 --> 14:00.190
Yukiya! Did you light the fire?

14:00.660 --> 14:02.800
What, it's not done yet?!

14:03.610 --> 14:05.190
Did you find something to eat?

14:05.190 --> 14:06.700
No! Not a thing!

14:07.880 --> 14:09.880
We can't count on Hachimine, either.

14:10.620 --> 14:13.310
Did he skip work to play around?

14:14.770 --> 14:17.500
Hey! I found some food!

14:17.500 --> 14:18.500
Seriously?!

14:19.030 --> 14:21.500
Yeah! Seaweed!

14:22.090 --> 14:25.390
Seaweed? We can eat it!

14:25.390 --> 14:27.850
It's hard! We can't eat this.

14:27.850 --> 14:31.090
And cream puffs.

14:31.090 --> 14:32.320
Cream puffs?

14:32.320 --> 14:33.770
Rocks

14:33.770 --> 14:35.220
that look like cream puffs.

14:35.220 --> 14:38.420
What?! We can't eat this!

14:38.420 --> 14:40.770
Why do you keep getting my hopes up?!

14:45.060 --> 14:48.660
And also, this <i>ika</i>...

14:47.930 --> 14:48.660
Squid?!

14:48.660 --> 14:50.400
...<i>da</i>!

14:50.660 --> 14:52.660
I knew it would be something...

14:53.450 --> 14:55.240
...like that!

14:55.240 --> 14:57.430
Wait, Akira! We can use this!

14:58.140 --> 15:01.370
Minabe-kun, this isn't
<i>ika</i> (squid), it's a <i>raft</i> (ikada).

15:01.570 --> 15:03.120
We can see that!

15:05.560 --> 15:09.180
Onward to Okinawa's main island!
Now, which way is it?

15:09.180 --> 15:11.430
I think it's this way.

15:10.130 --> 15:12.130
This way

15:10.130 --> 15:12.130
Main island

15:12.320 --> 15:13.880
Glasses!

15:14.840 --> 15:16.640
Now, eat up!

15:16.640 --> 15:18.640
Let's eat!

15:20.610 --> 15:22.380
It's great!

15:22.380 --> 15:25.250
Don't be so shy, Mitsuki-kun! Eat up!

15:25.090 --> 15:28.660
Meat

15:25.250 --> 15:27.380
This one and this one and
this one and this one!

15:27.380 --> 15:28.650
They're all cooked up!

15:30.870 --> 15:33.160
Yu-chan, get mine for m—

15:35.220 --> 15:37.690
Ikuto!

15:37.690 --> 15:39.110
Oops!

15:39.110 --> 15:41.860
Hayato, that's dangerous!
Turn off the hot plate!

15:41.860 --> 15:44.240
It's in the kitchen!

15:44.240 --> 15:46.680
Wait a minute!
Not until my meat is cooked!

15:45.520 --> 15:46.680
Meat

15:47.440 --> 15:49.160
It's on my sock!

15:48.460 --> 15:49.160
Sorry!

15:49.370 --> 15:50.920
Sorry won't cut it!

15:50.920 --> 15:54.180
Stop hiding and apologize now!

15:54.340 --> 15:56.930
Yu-chan! You're scary!

15:58.860 --> 16:00.230
Not gonna eat?

16:03.390 --> 16:05.450
I'm not very hungry.

16:07.800 --> 16:11.850
The president'll be back soon.
It's just a field trip.

16:13.170 --> 16:15.240
You don't understand.

16:15.460 --> 16:19.570
I miss him too, you know!
I really admire the preside—

16:19.570 --> 16:21.450
I hated glasses.

16:23.400 --> 16:27.050
But thanks to Soma-senpai,
I came to love them.

16:27.050 --> 16:30.500
Glasses, and the world
I see through my glasses...

16:31.690 --> 16:34.340
If not for Senpai,
everything would be dark.

16:34.950 --> 16:36.320
Everything around me...

16:38.180 --> 16:39.780
...would've been dark forever.

16:43.530 --> 16:46.390
So what will you do when
the president graduates?

16:47.160 --> 16:50.300
That's still a long way off, you know.

16:50.300 --> 16:52.730
Really? I've thought about it.

16:54.020 --> 16:58.780
I'm gonna finish the X-Ray Glasses,
get a lot of new club members,

16:58.780 --> 17:01.240
and develop more and more X-Ray Glasses!

17:02.200 --> 17:04.990
Then I'm gonna make the
president's Glasses Club

17:05.250 --> 17:07.250
the greatest it can be!

17:13.520 --> 17:15.070
Hayato!

17:15.070 --> 17:16.500
Whoops. Yeah?

17:20.780 --> 17:23.880
What's with Hayato,
saying something like that?

17:23.880 --> 17:25.420
Mitsuki!

17:25.980 --> 17:30.240
We've got avocado salad!
You like avocado, right?

17:34.990 --> 17:37.250
Well? Gonna have some?
Gonna have some?

17:38.650 --> 17:39.890
Glasses.

17:42.700 --> 17:47.380
Looking at a sight like this, all of my
fears from before seem so small.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.910
I wish we could stay like this forever.

17:52.220 --> 17:53.670
Wake up, eat a banana.

17:54.090 --> 17:56.390
Play in the ocean, eat a banana.

17:56.770 --> 17:59.490
Look at the stars, eat a banana. Right?

18:01.570 --> 18:03.420
Never!

18:03.420 --> 18:05.420
A shooting star!

18:04.620 --> 18:08.400
Okinawa main island! Okinawa main
island! Okinawa main island!

18:06.740 --> 18:08.400
You already said it three times.

18:08.770 --> 18:14.160
But, where are we?!

18:20.120 --> 18:21.420
Here is fine.

18:26.460 --> 18:28.020
Later, Mitsuki!

18:31.800 --> 18:33.400
I never got a chance

18:34.230 --> 18:35.940
to say thanks.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.930
Let's go, Norio-san.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.670
Glasses!

18:50.250 --> 18:51.760
Almost there.

18:51.760 --> 18:55.700
This is great! We're doing
pretty well by ourselves!

18:55.700 --> 18:58.390
Don't say that until it's finished.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.490
Hayato, you got it wrong here.

19:02.490 --> 19:04.440
Hmm? Where?

19:04.890 --> 19:07.200
You see the red cord here? Cut it.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.330
Roger!

19:08.330 --> 19:09.330
Idiot! Not that one!

19:13.610 --> 19:15.540
Who told you to cut the blue one?!

19:15.540 --> 19:16.850
What? Was that wrong?

19:17.380 --> 19:19.890
The red! The red cord!

19:20.400 --> 19:23.600
Oh, you said red?

19:24.160 --> 19:28.720
Hey, the president always says that
success is born from failure, right?

19:30.740 --> 19:34.730
Senpai would never fail <i>before</i> we finish.

19:30.740 --> 19:34.730
Save failure until after you finish.

19:35.350 --> 19:39.110
It was stupid of me to think
better of you, even for a minute.

19:41.690 --> 19:46.510
Help me! Help me, president!

19:41.690 --> 19:46.510
Get back here, Fake Glasses!

19:46.510 --> 19:48.510
Did you call me?

19:50.170 --> 19:51.470
President?

19:52.280 --> 19:53.930
Soma-senpai!

19:53.930 --> 19:54.900
Hey!

19:54.900 --> 19:56.760
Soma-senpai!

19:57.080 --> 19:58.500
Been well?

19:58.500 --> 19:59.500
Yes!

19:59.500 --> 20:03.230
Soma-kun! Go in already!

20:03.230 --> 20:06.180
Oh, sorry! Here we go!

20:06.180 --> 20:09.970
One, two! One, two!

20:12.850 --> 20:13.980
Okay!

20:18.010 --> 20:20.450
W-Welcome back...

20:20.450 --> 20:21.830
Thanks.

20:21.830 --> 20:22.860
It's good to see you again.

20:22.860 --> 20:24.900
What's with the log?

20:24.900 --> 20:28.420
This? This was our traveling companion.

20:29.240 --> 20:30.760
It's a souvenir for you two.

20:32.120 --> 20:34.850
I'm so happy, Soma-senpai!

20:34.850 --> 20:36.630
Hey, Hayato! Take that end!

20:41.860 --> 20:44.480
Hey, you went to Okinawa, right?

20:44.480 --> 20:47.230
Yes. It was just normal Okinawa at first.

20:47.230 --> 20:49.340
What? Did something happen?!

20:49.340 --> 20:53.350
Yes. We experienced a revolution
for glasses wearers,

20:53.350 --> 20:56.510
a type of diving called Sea Walk.

20:57.440 --> 20:58.650
Flump.

20:58.650 --> 21:02.520
Senpai! Senpai! Senpai!

22:34.670 --> 22:35.780
Student Council Room

22:39.390 --> 22:43.300
In summary: Soma Akira,
Hachimine Takuma,

22:43.300 --> 22:46.370
and Minabe Yukiya are
currently unaccounted for.

22:46.370 --> 22:48.810
What?! They haven't been found yet?!

22:48.810 --> 22:49.660
Yes.

22:49.660 --> 22:53.330
That's awful. S-Stomach pain...

22:51.620 --> 22:53.530
Stomach Pain

22:54.120 --> 22:55.820
M-Medicine...

23:00.610 --> 23:03.830
Hey. The three of them are
really still in Okinawa?

23:03.830 --> 23:06.840
They're unquestionably still
missing in Okinawa.

23:03.960 --> 23:06.960
Blatant
Lie

23:06.840 --> 23:10.040
Stomach pain...

23:11.790 --> 23:14.400
My glasses are Wellington celluloid frames.

23:13.010 --> 23:22.350
Wellington

23:14.400 --> 23:16.200
Mine are Wellington brow type.

23:16.200 --> 23:18.050
Mine are Wellington half-rim.

23:18.050 --> 23:19.890
Takuma-kun's are tortoiseshell, right?

23:18.060 --> 23:22.350
bad drawing (lol)

23:18.520 --> 23:22.350
shut up

23:19.890 --> 23:22.260
Tortoiseshell is sweet and delicious!

23:20.390 --> 23:22.350
Candy

23:22.260 --> 23:24.340
Takuma is so cute!

23:24.340 --> 23:25.960
No Glasses, No Life

23:31.240 --> 23:33.740
Oval square! Tomorrow's horoscope:

23:34.480 --> 23:38.340
Confess! Confess to the person you love!
